add.s is from the GNU binutils-gdb simulator test suite,
sim/testsuite/msp430/ (GNU General Public License 3 or later).
It runs unchanged: test/asm.c provides the start, pass and fail macros
of testutils.inc, with pass and fail writing 0 and 1 to the stop register.
The other tests there need MSP430X (rrux.s) or a hardware multiplier
(mpyull_hwmult.s), which mspsim does not simulate.
